    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 182 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Lunar New Year's Day)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "The first big holiday is Lunar New Year’s also known as seol-lal."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "The most important Lunar New Year custom is the ancestral"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "memorial ceremony."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Each member of the family gets up early in the morning"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and dresses in their best clothes."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Afterwards, we perform a ritual ceremony in honor of our ancestors."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Following the ceremony, the younger people bow to their elders"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "as a gesture of wishing everyone many new blessings"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "during the upcoming new year."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "To bow on the Lunar New Year is a special honor"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and privilege of showing respect to one’s elders."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        "1 번",
        "2 번",
        "3 번",
        "4 번",
        "5 번"
      ]
